//# Reference:    pp. 1452-1484
// PORT: SOURCE DISPLAY_INTERFACE_ROUTINES.agc:8
//# Contact:      Ron Burkey <info@sandroid.org>
// PORT: SOURCE DISPLAY_INTERFACE_ROUTINES.agc:9
